blugon-lite (1.0.0-lite) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Interactive TUI with urwid
    - Edit, add, delete schedules
    - Theme support (dark, dracula)
    - Automatic saving to ~/.config/blugon/gamma
  * CLI with multiple backends
    - SCG (Xrandr) - primary backend
    - xgamma - fallback backend
  * Preset configurations
    - evening, office, student, night-owl, minimal
  * Desktop integration
    - .desktop file for application menu
    - SVG icon
    - Bash completion
  * Documentation
    - README.md with usage examples
    - INSTALL.md with installation guide
    - Man page (blugon-lite.1)

 -- Jose MS <pepe@DebianPP.monodev.pw>  Tue, 25 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000
